HB0016 Used nuclear fuel storage-amendments.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to environmental quality; establishing requirements and
standards for the storage of used nuclear fuel; amending siting requirements
for used nuclear fuel storage facilities; providing definitions; making
conforming amendments; repealing obsolete provisions; requiring rulemaking; and
providing for effective dates.
